      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹9.84 (up from ₹9.56 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹127.2b (up 12% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹17.3b (up 2.9% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 14% (down from 15% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Revenue is forecast to grow 6.9% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 9.2% growth forecast for the Insurance industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 13% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 34% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
